      "created_at": "2024-09-27T08:56:35.180Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi everyone,</p>\n<p>i am running into an issue and and trying to deal with it.<br>\nwhen i tick off the “Apply Withholding Taxes” the template does show up in the purchase taxes and charges table, also including the “Purchase Taxes And Charges Template”. As shown in the picture below</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/0/70784ee3b3c5b26aa28dad1f79fe70088437ee85.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/70784ee3b3c5b26aa28dad1f79fe70088437ee85\" title=\"withholding tax and purchase taxes and charges template\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/0/70784ee3b3c5b26aa28dad1f79fe70088437ee85_2_690x104.png\" alt=\"withholding tax and purchase taxes and charges template\" data-base62-sha1=\"g2XeCb5BP93e44abozlnBjPfAMZ\" width=\"690\" height=\"104\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/0/70784ee3b3c5b26aa28dad1f79fe70088437ee85_2_690x104.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/0/70784ee3b3c5b26aa28dad1f79fe70088437ee85.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/0/70784ee3b3c5b26aa28dad1f79fe70088437ee85.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F8F8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">withholding tax and purchase taxes and charges template</span><span class=\"informations\">1025×155 13.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>but when i save the Purchase invoice, it gives me this error.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/3/03eea320935e7e6f42beeeee96fa97114a619c7e.png\" alt=\"can refer row\" data-base62-sha1=\"yMI2lzJqIN9WYRW4DotzLVJw1U\" width=\"581\" height=\"144\"></p>\n<p>i want to set the type to “On Previous Row Total” but cant seem to do so because of the error showing up, even though i have referred the row number in the row.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/4/e406b9afe92283b1d2bf9ed38281171f0f04c472.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/e406b9afe92283b1d2bf9ed38281171f0f04c472\" title=\"editing row for taxes\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/4/e406b9afe92283b1d2bf9ed38281171f0f04c472_2_690x386.png\" alt=\"editing row for taxes\" data-base62-sha1=\"wxdgStTmeZexyBN3JSk4zfgikQW\" width=\"690\" height=\"386\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/4/e406b9afe92283b1d2bf9ed38281171f0f04c472_2_690x386.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/4/e406b9afe92283b1d2bf9ed38281171f0f04c472.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/4/e406b9afe92283b1d2bf9ed38281171f0f04c472.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F8F8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">editing row for taxes</span><span class=\"informations\">1005×563 27.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>another thing that i would like to mention is that when i tick off the “Apply Tax Withholding”, it’s showing up the type of “On Net Actual” which i change it to “On Previous Row Total”</p>\n<p>if there’s a workaround this error then please let me know.</p>\n<p>Regards,<br>\nMuhammad Shouib Saeed</p>",
